{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 50 fast-paced levels and train your <strong>Soul Reflex</strong> in a high-speed, Rhythm-Action 3D Runner centered on a journey toward Spiritual Awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try, try, and try again as you visualize your mind's state and practice reaction time. Every run is a reflection of your focus, presence, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the flow, transcend the limits of the physical, and chase the Light to awaken your true potential. This is a challenge of precision, flow, and self-mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 Neon-Drenched Levels:</strong> A massive challenge to test your limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Power Ups:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Up:</strong> Build up enough speed to reach the finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra Jumps:</strong> Chain multiple jumps (double, triple... <strong>septuple jumps!</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increase Jump Distance:</strong> Longer jump hold time for massive leaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...<strong>and more</strong> to discover!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Lasers:</strong> Slow you down and break your momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Falling Floors:</strong> Keep moving\u2014hesitation means failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotating and Moving Platforms:</strong> Require quick decision-making and precision.</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:\u00a0</strong>The Ultimate Reflex Test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Stop Challenge:</strong> Experience a pr